OL,3,GNEWSAMotorway drivers face rush hour
OL,4,Adelays after crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FPart of the M6 in Cheshire has been
OL,7,Fclosed in both directions following a
OL,8,Fcrash.
OL,10,FTraffic England said emergency services
OL,11,Fhad been called to a collision at the
OL,12,FLymm Interchange near Warrington, where
OL,13,Fthe M6 meets junction 9 of the M56.
OL,15,FTraffic is being diverted via the exit
OL,16,Fand entry slip roads at junction 20 and
OL,17,Fthere are half-hour delays, with four
OL,18,Fmiles of congestion on the approach.
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
