OL,3,GNEWSAMotorway drivers face rush hour
OL,4,Adelays after crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FTraffic monitoring service Inrix said
OL,7,Fsouthbound M6 traffic had already built
OL,8,Fup to the Croft Interchange at junction
OL,9,F21. Those heading northbound can expect
OL,10,Fcongestion to before junction 19 for
OL,11,FKnutsford.
